- op: discuss  # 1701
  at: '2026-04-12T08:41:50Z'  # 1701
  by: agent  # 1701
  actor: jgstern_agent  # 1701
  clock: 7  # 1701
  nonce: '1701'  # 1701
  message: "Fixed in commit 1a4d0dc2a. go_cobra_linker now falls back to enclosing variable symbol when no function/method/class/module encloses the cobra.Command literal. Package-level var declarations like 'var rootCmd = &cobra.Command{RunE: rootRun}' now emit dispatches_to edges from the var symbol to the handler."  # 1701
